9c104",3,-7,1,"This function deserves an exhaustive review if it’s to be used, but I haven’t done it yet, because it’s hefty and my higher-level concerns about this design might render any comments moot."],["94627ccd_9046bc15",3,-7,0,"There should not be a large overhead because sha256 is calculated only once?"],["9747a7f7_ac9fedca",3,-7,0,"Thanks, this has bothered me for a while. ;)"],["ac0c5a84_c5c58efb",3,-6,1,"Does it make sense to pass the re-exported library's TOC path from GN instead, e.g. `-Wcrl,reexporttoc,<foo.TOC>` next to `-Wl,-reexport_library,<foo>`, and add `foo.TOC` to the target's inputs? Then…"]],0,1097],[8680380,20755,1,0.13,0.082,[[34,0]],[],0,1098],[8679840,20755,5,0.361,0.271,[[1,234]],[["649dede0_833fe9b9",2,0,1,"Take this issue?"]],0,1099]]}